Bring one real question from your own company. We answer as many as time allows, and we publish the answers afterwards.

## Who it is for

The webinar is for owners, finance managers and operations leads who are about to choose a new system, or who already regret their last choice. No technical knowledge is needed.

The link arrives by email after you register.
